{
  "label": "ramen1",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label ramen1:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen0",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen0.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen0"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I show up at a seedy ramen shop in the second half of town.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A noodle-sanctuary in a land of shit.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or as Tsuneyo calls it, home.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The walls are stone and stained with years worth of pork broth condensation, turning what I’m sure was a once-spotless restaurant into...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, into this.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But this is the ideal place for a dish like ramen.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s not meant to be fancy. It’s not meant to be gourmet.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s just food that warms the heart.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or at least what’s left of it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen1.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good evening. Welcome to Tojo Ramen.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please take your time looking over the menu and let me know if you have any questions.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen2.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You do realize it’s me, right? Your teacher?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t have to give me the same customary greeting that you give everyone else.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is no customary greeting. Everyone else just sits down.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have decided to greet you as today is a day to celebrate.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To celebrate what exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A curse free life.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re still going on about the curse?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am. The Emerald Guardian informed me that it was not a curse after all. Who knew?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I did. I literally told you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't remember that.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, it happened.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I apologize. I often find myself having a hard time paying attention while you're talking.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But you are alive. And that is all that truly matters.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm offended by the first part of that statement, but applaud you for ending on an insightful note.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen3.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am full of nothing but wisdom and noodles.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo passes me a menu after having just fulfilled her noodle-mention-quota for the night.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take a moment to look it over and realize that everything on the menu is insanely cheap.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It didn’t occur to me the first time I came here since I...wound up paying for two people, but I’m surprised Tsuneyo’s family is even able to stay in business with prices like these.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I feel like they haven't been updated in decades.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen2.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why is everything so cheap here?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen1.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cheap?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. You’re charging next to nothing for virtually every dish on the menu.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. You mean cheap.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...That’s exactly what I said?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen4.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I suppose it may have something to do with the people who live in this half of town.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure you have noticed, but the old district is not in the best of shape.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The most populous demographic in the area is the elderly. And next is the poor.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everyone else lives much further away.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen1.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All of the people stuck here are simply waiting to die.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...dark.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen3.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. I suppose it is.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen1.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you know what you’d like to order?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What kind of mood whiplash is this? Jumping straight from condemning the entire population here to taking my order?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I know Tsuneyo doesn't have much experience holding conversations, but...she at least has to learn how to transition between topics.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...can you tell me what the “Red Dragon” is?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It is the red version of the Green Dragon.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So it’s...spicier, I’m guessing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. Just like in ancient times.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The red dragons were much more dangerous than the green ones.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But dragons didn’t actually exist in ancient times. Those were just fairy tales.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen5.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you...really not know that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is a shocking revelation.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All this time, I have been explaining the difference between the dishes by mentioning the dragons of ancient times.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why did no one stop me?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you deal with mostly old people, right? They probably thought it was cute that you still believed in them.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are old people actually evil?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A lot of the time, yeah.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen6.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I must remain vigilant in the face of the elderly. They could attack at any moment.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's fine. They'll die before the rest of us, so you likely won't have to remain vigilant for very long.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen1.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I look forward to that day with great anticipation. Praise be.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Praise be.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, what are we praising?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles, perhaps?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...anyway, I guess I’ll have the Green Dragon since it's...less red than the Red Dragon.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I understand.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One Green Dragon, coming up.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As a word of advice, dragons are not real. The dish is based on a fictional creature from fairy tales.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, Tsuneyo. I am the one who taught you this.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are lying. This is information I have known all along.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now, please excuse me while I go craft a dish named after a fictional creature that did not actually exist in ancient times.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen0",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen0.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen0"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo disappears behind the curtain leading to the kitchen and I can hear her beginning to search through some shelves or cabinets or something.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder why she’d need to go back there when it looks like all of the ingredients are right behind her?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe the Green Dragon requires some sort of...special ingredients they store in the back?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh well. Not like it matters anyway. I’m just glad to be able to eat something.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Coming to this part of town is always draining, both physically and mentally- and I'm barely able to stay awake as-is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen1.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have returned.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, good timing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This ain’t my first rodeo, bro.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Still at it with the whole informal speech thing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I improving?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're getting worse, actually. That was extremely unnatural.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen6.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ugh...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s fine. I’m already teaching one girl how to improve her public speaking and, weirdly enough, you seem much more open to learning.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen7.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You offer additional classes?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...not exactly. I kind of just show up to her work every once in a while and...accidentally insult her until she improves.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you come here to insult me?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": On my home turf?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Watch your step, bro.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo, you can’t just keep adding bro to sentences to make them informal. That isn’t how it works.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure? Because I have studied our Yakuza clientele and have heard them use that word many times before.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why in the world are the Yakuza coming to a ramen shop in the middle of the old district?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen8.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because I am a food magician.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My flavors are unparalleled in the world of ramen.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They also occasionally used the back room to do business before my father fell ill.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What kind of business were they doing back there exactly?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Apparently, they work in real estate.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And all this time, I thought they were some sort of gang.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If more people knew their true goal was to provide affordable housing, I believe less people would fear them.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're not serious, are you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen9.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What did I do now?...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing, Tsuneyo. I can’t teach you two valuable life lessons in one day.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why is talking to you so much harder than it is talking to anyone else?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who knows? Even I don’t understand my actions sometimes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s like, I’ll just be walking around, minding my own business...and suddenly, I’m sitting in a ramen shop teaching some girl about dragons.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen1.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That sounds extremely similar to what happened here today.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It is what happened here today.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Right. Of course.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Perhaps it was hunger that landed you here? That would make sense, would it not?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It would, but I don't think that's something you need to verbally rationalize.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would you prefer to eat in silence?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t even have any food yet.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s cooking.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The Green Dragon requires special preparation.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What kind of special preparation? I don't even know what I-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Snake venom.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Don’t tell me that’s what she was doing when she went into the kitchen?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": On second thought, I don’t know if I want the Green-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was a joke.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Surprise.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You really need to work on your delivery.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everything you say comes out in the same tone, so I can never tell when you’re kidding or not.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you really think we would use snake venom in ramen?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is absurd.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It would never work.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen10.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unless...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unless what? What are you thinking right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tell me- how much do you cherish your life?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Enough to not agree to whatever you want me to agree with.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is a shame. I had an excellent idea for a new menu item.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How is it excellent if you don’t even know it’s safe to consume?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": With great risk comes great reward. Thomas Jefferson said that.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thomas who?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen11.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is he a mythical creature as well?!",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I just wanted to see how you'd react if I pretended he was.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen12.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s a relief. I was beginning to think everything I was taught had been a lie.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Life was much simpler before I had to begin using my knowledge in real life.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. I can see how homeschooling might leave some people behind.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene firsttsuneyoramen1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/firsttsuneyoramen1.webp",
      "alt": "firsttsuneyoramen1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will do my best to learn the right meanings to things in your class.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...try and have fun. Knowledge comes second.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I understand. I will do my best to prioritize having fun over improving myself as a person.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There you go. Just don’t expect too much from me and I'm sure you'll have a decently fulfilling school life.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My expectations could not be any lower.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that's kind of insulting.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Another joke. Ha ha ha ha ha.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The real joke here is your sense of humor.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow. You’re even worse than I am.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was not my proudest moment just now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should be ashamed.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am. You don't have to-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Get out of my restaurant, you bastard.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was a joke too, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
